        'en' => [
            'title' => 'Laser engraving for events: orders and collection',
            'slug' => 'live-laser-engraving-at-events',
            'excerpt' => 'Plan personalised event gifts: collect orders, engrave them in a suitable workshop and arrange collection or delivery. Explore costs and safe working.',
            'blocks' => [
                [ 'p', 'You can organise laser engraving for events without running a laser around guests. Collect names and orders before the event or at a stand, engrave them in a suitably equipped workshop and hand over the finished items as agreed. For orders taken during the event, agree a later collection or delivery date with each customer.' ],
                [ 'p', 'This approach works for corporate gifts, trade fairs, weddings and markets. Below are product ideas, a way to collect details, a production plan and a pricing method. We do not assume a fixed turnaround: agree one after testing the job and checking workshop capacity.' ],
                [ 'h2', 'Two ways to organise event orders' ],
                [ 'p', 'The choice depends on when you know the recipients. Both approaches let you prepare the design and operate the laser away from the event.' ],
                [
                    'ul',
                    [ 'Orders before the event: the organiser gathers names and approves the design. Engrave the batch in the workshop, check the lettering and deliver the finished gifts before the event starts.', 'Orders at the stand: the guest chooses an item and provides the wording. After the event, engrave it in the workshop and arrange collection or delivery as agreed.', 'You can combine the two: prepare some gifts in advance and accept additional orders at the event.' ],
                ],
                [ 'p', 'Do not promise collection during the event if production happens later. Agree in advance how wording will be approved, the delivery cost and a deadline you can meet.' ],
                [ 'h2', 'What can you prepare for companies and guests?' ],
                [ 'p', 'Choose items that suit the audience, budget and materials available in your workshop. Test a sample from the same batch before accepting an order: coating and alloy affect the result.' ],
                [
